      "message": "[error] Line 276: 🔴 `onComplete` is only called from `onNext`/`onError`. If `accountService.loadMore(...)` completes without emitting (e.g., empty history page / terminal completion without item), the callback is never invoked, leaving navigation state pending and blocking subsequent history requests. Trigger the callback from terminal signals (`doFinally { ... }` or `subscribe(onNext, onError, onComplete)`) so it runs exactly once on success, empty completion, and error.",
